WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
(crowd applauds)
- Congrats on the Emmy!

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:04.291
- Oh, man, thank you so much.

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:05.630
- Yeah.
(crowd applauds)

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:08.840
- It's so well-deserved.
How did you guys celebrate?

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.800
- Well, we were like the fortunate few

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.670
who got to actually be
together because we were,

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:19.170
or a bunch of us at least,
were in Canada at the time,

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:22.970
and at that point, Canada was
doing a lot better COVID-wise

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:23.803
than the States.

00:00:23.803 --> 00:00:26.790
So we got to all be together
and we all tested and isolated

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:29.830
and all that stuff, so
we got to be together,

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:32.960
which was so amazing because
it was just one of those nights

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.770
that you will never, ever forget,

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.300
and so it was all such a blur,

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.104
and then the next thing I know,

00:00:40.104 --> 00:00:44.100
I look over and Noah
Reid, who plays Patrick

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.270
and Noah's wife were standing there

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:49.070
with a tray of tequila shots,

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:51.920
and then the next thing I know after that,

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.920
I'm reaching for a tequila
shot with Eugene Levy

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.090
and Catherine O'Hara and
Dan and all of the cast,

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:03.090
and that, as I recall,
happened more than once,

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:04.348
and maybe more than twice.

00:01:04.348 --> 00:01:06.610
- (laughs) And then the
next moment you were

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:08.453
in the bathroom with your hair.

00:01:10.809 --> 00:01:12.570
- Yeah, no, the next moment, I was,

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:15.790
actually the very next
day I was on an airplane

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:16.930
to fly to Boston

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:19.610
to start shooting "Kevin
Can (beep) Himself."

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.510
- Oh my gosh, you were hurting.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:25.694
- Mm, I dragged my decomposing
corpse onto that airplane.

00:01:25.694 --> 00:01:26.953
But I made it.

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:29.280
- (laughing) I love,
you know what, though?

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.540
That is worth it.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:32.090
I would do, I'm not even part of the show,

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:33.450
and I would've been like, "I'm in!"

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:34.510
That's a great crew.

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:35.343
- [Annie] Oh, yeah, yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:35.343 --> 00:01:36.579
- No regrets, no regrets whatsoever.

00:01:36.579 --> 00:01:37.412
- Oh my god.

